    {
      "duration_frames": 120,
      "from_frame": 0,
      "text": "Before you ask AI to research, finish this sentence."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 120,
      "text": "I need this research so I can decide whether to test a meeting-note assistant."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 330,
      "text": "Now define the task: turn approved notes into an editable draft, with missing details visible."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 540,
      "text": "Ask for a short comparison against those requirements, with a source for each factual claim."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 750,
      "text": "This example table uses invented options. One sends automatically; another keeps the draft for review."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 960,
      "text": "The second fits this test better. That is a checklist result, not proof the product works."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1140,
      "text": "A person still checks the current terms and tries a harmless sample before connecting team information."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1320,
      "text": "Write the decision first. Then collect only the information needed to make it."
    }
  ],
